, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: initial; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">진행안내</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif;\">01.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: initial; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">진행절차&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: initial; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">참가신청&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: initial; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">⇨ 예선진출자 발표</span><span style=\"color: initial; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: initial; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">⇨&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: initial; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-siz