&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: initial; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">행사특전</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif;\">01. 예선진출자 전원</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">-예선 당일 : PT 및 GD 후 개별 피드백</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">-예선 이후 : 3월 중 이미지메이킹 또는 스피치 특강 제공</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans