</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">]</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">한국산업인력공단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">월간인재경영</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, HR insight,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">한국강사신문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">커리어코치협회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, 코멘토,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">한경잡앤조이, 뉴스앤잡</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
